From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: owner <owner@localhost>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 22:19:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 03/11] Taviri: desktop unlock connects to the Taviri desktop
 app

The extension's native-messaging host comes from nativeMessagingHost in
webpack/smartfill-brand/brand.json (io.github.perlytiara.taviri), injected at
build time, in both the native messaging background and the desktop IPC
transport. The extension therefore never talks to the official Bitwarden
desktop app; without the setting (tests, SMARTFILL_BRANDING=off) it keeps
Bitwarden's com.8bit.bitwarden.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
